Styled words wrap without losing content; paragraph gaps and heading baselines are measured.
-- input.1 --
.TH TOOL 1 "2026-10-21" "Example tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tool \- inspect documents
.SH DESCRIPTION
A paragraph with
.B bold
and
.I italic
and \f[BI]both\f[R] words across physical source lines.
.PP
This second paragraph wraps naturally across the available width while retaining all its content.
